  "Items.SalamanderFirewater.TailNone": "[pg]You drop onto the ground as your spine twists and grows, forcing the flesh above your [ass] to bulge out. New bones form, one after another, building a tapered, prehensile tail onto the back of your body. <b>You now have a reptilian tail!</b>"
