  "Items.SalamanderFirewater.LegsTaur": "[pg]Your lower body is wracked by pain! Once it passes, you discover that you're standing on digitigrade legs with salamander-like claws."
  "Items.SalamanderFirewater.LegsFeet": "[pg]You scream in agony as you feel the bones in your legs break and begin to rearrange. They change to a digitigrade shape while your feet grow claws and shift to have three toes on the front and a smaller toe on the heel."
  "Items.SalamanderFirewater.LegsOther": "[pg]Pain rips through your [legs], morphing and twisting them until the bones rearrange into a digitigrade configuration. The strange legs have three-toed, clawed feet, complete with a small vestigial claw-toe on the back for added grip."
  "Items.SalamanderFirewater.LegsEnd": " <b>You have salamander legs and claws!</b>"
